B.ND=new A.d4("SpotMyCity","iOS & Android Developer","2017 \u2013 2019",B.Yo,u.y,B.rK,B.uh,"Paris, France","SpotMyCity is a new social network to save and share spots with friends. Whether you're looking for a restaurant or a hotel close to you or on the other side of the planet, it is all about finding cool spots, shared by people you trust, your community.\nSpotMyCity has 5 key features:\n\u2022 SPOT saves the place you are in into 3 categories: Yes (I like it), No (I don't), or Soon (I want to go). You can share your experience by uploading 3 pictures and adding a comment of up to 140 characters.\n\u2022 EXPLORE is your research tool. Find a spot and see those of your friends on a map.\n\u2022 STROLL takes you on a ride. Save the spots you discover on this page and add them to your \"Soon\" list!\n\u2022 PEOPLE is your world, your friends, your community. See their latest spots and start a chat to connect with them.\n\u2022 PROFILE is your identity. Manage your conversations, followers, and following. Access the spots you have saved.\n\nSPOTMYCITY is:\n\n\u2022 An iOS app\n\u2022 A user-friendly app to save all your spots and instantly share your experience with your followers\n\u2022 An app that brings new places into your life and reduces disappointments\n\u2022 An app that increases the chances of a fabulous experience on your travels\n\u2022 An app that makes you crave amazing spots all over the world\n\u2022 A way to discover places from the people you trust, wherever you are")
