B.NH=new A.d4("TotalEnergies","iOS & Android Developer","2020 \u2013 2021",B.WK,u.Q,B.ts,B.qm,"Paris, France","The TotalEnergies My Card app is a free digital tool designed for professionals holding a TotalEnergies Fleet or Mobility Corporate card. It simplifies expense management by allowing users to locate stations/charging points, scan receipts, and track expenses in real-time.\nHere are the key features of the My Card app:\nExpense Management: Scan invoices and receipts directly, eliminating paper clutter.\nLocation: Find TotalEnergies service stations and charging points (over 300,000 across Europe) along your route.\nReal-time Tracking: View transaction history and spending limits.\nServices: Access information on stations (hours, fuels) and charging points (availability, power, connector type).\nSecurity: Option to block the card in case of loss or theft.\nThis application is the essential complement to corporate mobility cards, available on iOS and Android.")
B.Un=s(["Worked on Acc\xe8sD and Caisse Scolaire mobile apps.","Delivered new security and fraud-prevention features for millions of users.","Improved biometric authentication flow and enhanced secure notification pipeline.","Designed and developed the new Dreams module for Caisse Scolaire."],t.s)
B.rs=s(["assets/images/experiences/desjardins/desjardins_1.png","assets/images/experiences/desjardins/desjardins_2.png","assets/images/experiences/desjardins/desjardins_3.png","assets/images/experiences/desjardins/desjardins_4.png","assets/images/experiences/desjardins/desjardins_5.png","assets/images/experiences/desjardins/desjardins_6.png","assets/images/experiences/desjardins/desjardins_7.png","assets/images/experiences/desjardins/desjardins_8.png"],t.s)
